PROVENANCE
----------

This plugin descends from the "Line Operations" plugin in the geany-plugins
project:

    https://plugins.geany.org/lineoperations.html
    Copyright (C) 2015 Sylvan Mostert <smostert.dev@gmail.com>
    Licensed GPL-2+

Upstream's original version, the file layout and substantial parts of the
implementation are reused here, and every source file carries its
copyright header. Those contributions remain under the GPL, which is why
this program as a whole is GPL-2-or-later and cannot be relicensed under
more permissive terms.

Notepad++ (https://notepad-plus-plus.org/), whose command set this plugin
reimplements, is likewise GPL-licensed. It places no constraint here: no
Notepad++ source code was copied, and neither a command list nor the idea
of sorting lines is copyrightable expression.


